{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47907","headline":"霅溪夜宴诗 四 · 水神","name":"霅溪夜宴诗 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君不见夜来渡口拥千艘，中载万姓之脂膏。\n当楼船泛泛於叠浪，恨珠贝又轻於鸿毛。\n又不见朝来津亭维一舠，中有一士青其袍。\n赴宰邑之良日，任波吼而风号。\n是知溺名溺利者，不免爲水府之腥臊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"水神","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47907.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47907","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}